/// The resource check result for the queried spec
/// *VsanResourceCheckSpec*.
/// 
/// This structure may be used only with operations rendered under `/vsan`.
///
/// ### How to access
/// - `VsanResourceCheckSystem::vsan_get_resource_check_status().result?`
